@startuml
title Secured merchant order and reconciliation — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|Merchant system|
start
:SubmitMerchantOrder with key and externalOrderId;
|Merchant API|
if (Key active, business Approved, scope and input valid?) then (yes)
  :Atomic unique merchant/order job + fingerprint;
else (no)
  :Return 400/401/403;
  stop
endif
if (Changed duplicate?) then (yes)
  :409 conflict;
  stop
endif
:Return 202 job Location; parcel IDs null;
|Merchant inbox processor|
:Claim durable Accepted/Retrying job;
:CreateBooking with stable merchant/order identity;
if (Known successful result?) then (yes)
  :Persist Created with parcel/tracking;
else (no)
  if (Permanent domain rejection?) then (yes)
    :Persist Failed with safe reason;
  else (unknown outcome)
    :Persist Retrying and nextRetryAt;
    :GetBookingByExternalOrder;
    if (Parcel found?) then (yes)
      :Persist Created;
    else (NotFound)
      :Schedule same-key CreateBooking retry;
    endif
  endif
endif
|Merchant system|
:GetMerchantOrder with owning credential;
:Observe Accepted/Retrying/Created/Failed;
stop
@enduml
